message: >-
  Cite the archived software version using its version-specific Zenodo DOI; the
  concept DOI below resolves to the latest archived version.
title: 'Cosmic Futures Laboratory: a numerical laboratory for conditional cosmological futures'
type: software
repository-code: 'https://github.com/pandakingpunc/cosmic-futures-laboratory'
version: 0.3.0
date-released: '2026-09-24'
